---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="🎮 ゲーム"
  description="サクラと一緒にガジェット知識を楽しく試せるミニゲームコーナーです！"
>
  <div class="games-page">
    <div class="games-hero">
      <div class="sakura-intro">
        <div class="chibi-wrapper">
          <img class="sakura-img chibi-light" src="/images/games/chibi/sakura_chibi_v2_01_nobg.png" alt="サクラ" />
          <img class="sakura-img chibi-dark" src="/images/games/chibi/black/sakura_chibi_black_01_nobg.png" alt="サクラ" />
        </div>
        <div class="speech-bubble">
          <p>ようこそ、ゲームコーナーへ！🌸<br>ガジェット知識を試してみてね！</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h1 class="games-title">🎮 ゲームコーナー</h1>
      <p class="games-subtitle">楽しみながらガジェット通になろう！</p>
    </div>

    <div class="games-grid">
      <!-- ガジェットクイズ: 実装済み -->
      <a href="/games/quiz/" class="game-card game-card--active">
        <div class="game-card__icon">🧠</div>
        <div class="game-card__content">
          <h2 class="game-card__title">ガジェットクイズ</h2>
          <p class="game-card__desc">ガジェットのスペック・用語・豆知識を4択で出題！10問チャレンジ！</p>
          <span class="game-card__badge game-card__badge--available">遊べるよ！</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- じゃんけん: 実装済み -->
      <a href="/games/janken/" class="game-card game-card--active">
        <div class="game-card__icon">✊</div>
        <div class="game-card__content">
          <h2 class="game-card__title">サクラとじゃんけん</h2>
          <p class="game-card__desc">サクラとじゃんけん勝負！10回勝負でスコアを競おう！</p>
          <span class="game-card__badge game-card__badge--available">遊べるよ！</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- キャッチ: 実装済み -->
      <a href="/games/catch/" class="game-card game-card--active">
        <div class="game-card__icon">🎯</div>
        <div class="game-card__content">
          <h2 class="game-card__title">ガジェットキャッチ</h2>
          <p class="game-card__desc">落ちてくるガジェットをキャッチしてスコアを稼ごう！30秒タイマー制！</p>
          <span class="game-card__badge game-card__badge--available">遊べるよ！</span>
        </div>
      </a>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .games-page {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1rem 4rem;
  }

  .games-hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .sakura-intro {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .chibi-wrapper { flex-shrink: 0; }

  .sakura-img {
    width: 100px;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }
  .chibi-dark { display: none; }
  [data-theme="dark"] .chibi-light { display: none; }
  [data-theme="dark"] .chibi-dark { display: block; }

  .speech-bubble {
    background: var(--bubble-bg, #fff0f5);
    border: 2px solid #f9a8c9;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    max-width: 280px;
    position: relative;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    text-align: left;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .speech-bubble::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: -14px;
    bottom: 20px;
    border: 7px solid transparent;
    border-right-color: #f9a8c9;
  }

  .speech-bubble::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: -10px;
    bottom: 21px;
    border: 6px solid transparent;
    border-right-color: var(--bubble-bg, #fff0f5);
  }

  .games-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .games-subtitle {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .games-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .game-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .game-card--active {
    border-color: #f9a8c9;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-surface) 0%, #fff0f5 100%);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  [data-theme="dark"] .game-card--active {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-surface) 0%, #2a1a2e 100%);
    border-color: #c06080;
  }

  .game-card--active:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
    border-color: #f06090;
  }

  .game-card--soon {
    opacity: 0.65;
    cursor: default;
  }

  .game-card__icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .game-card__content {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .game-card__title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .game-card__desc {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .game-card__badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .game-card__badge--available {
    background: #f9a8c9;
    color: #7d1a40;
  }

  .game-card__badge--soon {
    background: var(--color-surface-raised);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .games-title { font-size: 1.5rem; }
    .games-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .sakura-img { width: 72px; }
  }
</style>
